msgid "Element-wise subtraction (``lf - other``)."
msgstr "元素级减法（``lf - other``）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.sub:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to the ``-`` operator (``__sub__``), so ``lf - other`` is "
"equivalent to ``lf.sub(other)``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``-`` 运算符（``__sub__``），所以 ``lf - other`` 等价于 ``lf.sub("
"other)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.sub of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.sub:6 of
msgid "Value to subtract from each element of ``lf``."
msgstr "从 ``lf`` 的每个元素中减去的值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.sub of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.sub:9 of
msgid "Lazy frame with element-wise difference of ``lf`` and ``other``."
msgstr "具有 ``lf`` 和 ``other`` 元素级差值的惰性框架。"

